#: ../../source/users/reports/nomenclature/reload_nomenclature.rst:5
msgid "Reload nomenclature"
msgstr "重新装入术语"

#: ../../source/users/reports/nomenclature/reload_nomenclature.rst:7
msgid ""
"When any `element`_ is added or any `element property`_ is edited, the "
"changes are not updated at the nomenclature automatically. To update the "
"`element properties`_ at the nomenclature, the nomenclature has to be "
"reload."
msgstr ""
"当添加任何 `元件 <element_>`_ 或编辑任何 `元素属性 <element property_>`_ 时，更改将不会在名称中自动更新。 "
"要在名称中更新 `元素属性 <element properties_>`_，术语必须重新加载 。"

#: ../../source/users/reports/nomenclature/reload_nomenclature.rst:10
msgid "To reload the nomenclature:"
msgstr "重新装入名称："

#: ../../source/users/reports/nomenclature/reload_nomenclature.rst:12
msgid ""
"Select the nomenclature table, or one of the nomenclature tables if there is"
" more than one, to display the nomenclature properties at `selection "
"properties panel`_."
msgstr ""
"在 `选择属性面板 <selection properties panel_>`_ 上显示名称属性，请选择名称表，或者如果有多个名称表之一。"

#: ../../source/users/reports/nomenclature/reload_nomenclature.rst:13
msgid "Go to **Content** tab."
msgstr "转到 **Content** 标签 。"

#: ../../source/users/reports/nomenclature/reload_nomenclature.rst:14
msgid ""
"Click **Reload** |view-refresh| button to update `element properties`_ at "
"nomenclature."
msgstr "点击 **重新装入** |view-refresh| 按钮在名称上更新 `元素属性 <element properties_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/reports/nomenclature/reload_nomenclature.rst:21
msgid "view-refresh"
msgstr "重新视图"

#: ../../source/users/reports/nomenclature/reload_nomenclature.rst:19
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech nomenclature properties panel, content tab"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 术语属性面板，内容标签"
